01:07:49.340 --> 01:07:58.860
Like you have to remember the creators of this game, like they basically created their own religion, their own philosophy, their own world, their own towns.

01:07:58.860 --> 01:08:19.180
Like they really went out and built a world on the promise of, you know, the tabletop games of Dungeons and Dragons for real in Ultima 4 in a way that like maybe like Final Fantasy and Dragon Warrior only do like 25% of as much.

01:08:19.180 --> 01:08:25.960
Like you don't, you don't wind up questioning as much in those worlds because everything is just stated to you so matter-of-factly.

01:08:26.300 --> 01:08:33.260
Whereas in Ultima 4, like there is this larger thing going on than just you, the player.

01:08:33.460 --> 01:08:38.920
And you're not just like one of the, you're not just like one of the heroes of light, you know?

01:08:39.020 --> 01:08:42.140
You're not like predestined to be the best.

01:08:42.140 --> 01:08:49.100
Like you're playing as the quote-unquote avatar who just has to be you doing the adventure.

01:08:49.320 --> 01:08:51.220
You get to play this game how you want.

01:08:51.320 --> 01:08:53.140
And so I think all that stuff is very interesting.

